["<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Taking on ServiceNow: Coding Agents the Rest of Us with Serval Co-Founder and CEO Jake Stauch TAM SDLC vibe coding ITSM\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-10-29-nopriors-ai-智能体越聪明-大企业反而把权限收得更紧/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/b4599cbd3b872acf-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"N\"><span class=\"dur\">38:05</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">No Priors</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1029</span></div>\n<h2>AI 智能體越聰明，大企業反而把權限收得更緊</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">Jake Stauch 認為模型越強，權限濫用能造成的破壞就越大，企業只能把默認權限收到最小，再靠一層審批系統放行例外——這正是 Serval 要賣的東西。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">企業軟件</span><span class=\"tag\">編碼智能體</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"sci\" data-hay=\"How Do You Take a Picture of a Black Hole? VLBI (Very Long Baseline Interferometry) event horizon black hole mimicker frame dragging\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-10-29-thejoyofwhy-银河系自己的黑洞太活跃-第一张黑洞照片拍的是更远的m87/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/b36fc769727aa196-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">59:45</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"sci\"><span class=\"src\">The Joy of Why</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1029</span></div>\n<h2>銀河系自己的黑洞太活躍，第一張黑洞照片拍的是更遠的M87</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">銀河系中心黑洞質量小、物質繞轉週期只有半小時，一夜之內形貌就會變；M87黑洞重達60億太陽質量，同一夜觀測裡幾乎靜止，反而更容易成像。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">黑洞</span><span class=\"tag\">天文觀測</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ideas\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"A Conversation With The Wealthy Barber (Dave Chilton) | #433 RRSP TFSA RESP AUM model segregated fund RRSP meltdown strategy\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-10-29-rationalreminder-自动储蓄的人不是以后才快乐-而是现在就更快乐/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/0e52c937f0d183da-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">1:21:20</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ideas\"><span class=\"src\">Rational Reminder</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1029</span></div>\n<h2>自動儲蓄的人不是以後才快樂，而是現在就更快樂</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">做了40年理財教育之後，《The Wealthy Barber》作者發現：強制自動儲蓄不是用現在的剋制換未來的安穩，而是讓人當下就更少焦慮、更快樂——延遲滿足的傳統說法反而講反了。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">退休規劃</span><span class=\"tag\">金融顧問</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"The Manhattan Project, Take Two mirror imaging entity resolution RBAC/ABAC IL6 FinOps Genesis mission\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-10-29-chinatalk-美国政府的ai预算两年前就定死-却要追着算力账单跑/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/7e7ccc037b1d3a98-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"C\"><span class=\"dur\">45:50</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">ChinaTalk</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1029</span></div>\n<h2>美國政府的AI預算兩年前就定死，卻要追著算力賬單跑</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">國會撥款的預算週期要兩年起步，但大模型和算力賬單按月變化；真正的解法不是省錢，而是讓預算能在不同模型、不同用途之間打通調配。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">聯邦政府AI</span><span class=\"tag\">出口管制</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"What Wall Street Really Thinks About the AI Trade Now neoclouds pod shop / multi-manager fund frontier sink AI factor open weight model\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-10-29-oddlots-ai融资风险已摆在眼前-仍有四成投资者视而不见/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/dbb9160e6d589beb-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"O\"><span class=\"dur\">41:10</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">Odd Lots</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1029</span></div>\n<h2>AI融資風險已擺在眼前，仍有四成投資者視而不見</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">巴克萊調查顯示只有60%的投資者認為AI融資會出問題，但CoreWeave、Cipher等公司近幾週的真實遭遇早已說明答案本該是100%，市場仍處在否認階段。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">AI泡沫</span><span class=\"tag\">數據中心融資</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"hist\" data-hay=\"Shadows, war, and finding Moomin joy GARM The Groke Moomin Characters Oy Limited\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-10-29-throughline-姆明的第一本书只卖了219本-真正让它爆红的是第三本/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"https://npr.brightspotcdn.com/dims3/default/strip/false/crop/1646x1646+0+0/resize/3000/quality/66/format/jpg/?url=http%3A%2F%2Fnpr-brightspot.s3.amazonaws.com%2F26%2Fcc%2F0e9f396b43a2b6ae03ba86b3f606%2Fd3ab8c80-c449-4882-8644-470d9f6df324.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">51:46</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"hist\"><span class=\"src\">Throughline</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1029</span></div>\n<h2>姆明的第一本書只賣了219本，真正讓它爆紅的是第三本</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">姆明的前兩本書是她在二戰轟炸聲中寫下的末日寓言，幾乎無人問津；真正讓她成名的第三本不再直接寫戰爭，卻仍留了一個陰森角色提醒讀者恐懼從未真正消失。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">芬蘭歷史</span><span class=\"tag\">二戰</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Why SoftBank paid me 17 yen to skip the air conditioning demand response virtual power plant base load peaker plant stranded generation CapEx / OpEx\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-10-29-complexsys-ai数据中心全天候运转-芯片折旧比电费贵5到10倍/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/5cd9c21e737bb124-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"C\"><span class=\"dur\">26:44</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">Complex Systems</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1029</span></div>\n<h2>AI數據中心全天候運轉：芯片折舊比電費貴5到10倍</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">AI推理的芯片折舊是電費的五到十倍，比特幣挖礦只有一點五到三倍，這個比例差決定了AI數據中心會全天候運行而不是像礦機那樣為省電隨時停機。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">電力市場</span><span class=\"tag\">虛擬電廠</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"hist\" data-hay=\"Easter Island Moai Manavai Rano Raraku Pukao Tangata Manu Mata&#x27;a\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-10-29-ancients-复活节岛不是生态自杀-杀死人口的是欧洲瘟疫-不是滥伐森林/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/a572716032db7f6f-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">1:04:08</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"hist\"><span class=\"src\">The Ancients</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1029</span></div>\n<h2>復活節島不是生態自殺：殺死人口的是歐洲瘟疫，不是濫伐森林</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">歐洲人在庫克船長抵達前四年已登島，帶來島民毫無免疫力的舊大陸疾病，真正摧毀人口的是這場瘟疫，而不是島民自己造成的森林濫伐。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">考古學</span><span class=\"tag\">太平洋史</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"hist\" data-hay=\"Medieval Ghost Stories Purgatory Harlequin haunt Byland Abbey ghost stories\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-10-29-historyhit-新教没有赶走中世纪的鬼-只是换成了更凶的恶魔/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/06ac7e08f7ad2c21-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"D\"><span class=\"dur\">27:55</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"hist\"><span class=\"src\">History Hit</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1029</span></div>\n<h2>新教沒有趕走中世紀的鬼，只是換成了更兇的惡魔</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">新教徒說鬼魂是天主教迷信，但他們解釋靈異的辦法不是取消它，而是把討債的鬼換成了更危險的惡魔——詹姆斯六世1597年寫的《惡魔學》就是證據。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">鬼故事</span><span class=\"tag\">中世紀</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"hist\" data-hay=\"718. The Suez Crisis: Britain&#x27;s Shattered Empire (Part 2) special relationship Eisenhower Doctrine lie doggo\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-10-29-restishistory-苏伊士战场英法完胜埃及-真正让他们撤军的是美国一通电话/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/e06c9ce2b8657d9d-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">1:16:31</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"hist\"><span class=\"src\">The Rest Is History</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1029</span></div>\n<h2>蘇伊士戰場英法完勝埃及，真正讓他們撤軍的是美國一通電話</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">英法兩天內摧毀埃及空軍，地面戰線節節推進，卻因英鎊在美國施壓下瀕臨崩盤，被迫倉促下令停火撤軍。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">蘇伊士危機</span><span class=\"tag\">英美關係</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"hist\" data-hay=\"408. JFK: Nixon, McCarthy, &amp; The Dark Side of Camelot (Part 2) Addison&#x27;s disease lobotomy Profiles in Courage\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-10-29-empirehist-肯尼迪意外输掉副总统候选提名-反而一夜成为全国新星/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/6dcfd4bf69c91d0f-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"E\"><span class=\"dur\">49:44</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"hist\"><span class=\"src\">Empire 世界史</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1029</span></div>\n<h2>肯尼迪意外輸掉副總統候選提名，反而一夜成為全國新星</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">1956年民主黨史無前例地把副總統提名交給大會代表現場票選，肯尼迪雖在最後一輪惜敗，卻因此第一次成為全國矚目的政治新星，還躲開了那年大選慘敗的責任。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">政治史</span><span class=\"tag\">肯尼迪</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ideas\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"E257｜對話Vitalik：AI安全背後的哲學思想，有效利他主義如何影響硅谷？ EA (Effective Altruism) e/acc d/acc Neglectedness P(doom) Orthogonality thesis\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-10-28-sv101-vitalik锐评anthropic-安全话术与自身权力相关性超九成/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/fa770e4b48e5ff1b-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"硅\"><span class=\"dur\">1:52:34</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ideas\"><span class=\"src\">硅谷101</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1028</span></div>\n<h2>Vitalik銳評Anthropic：安全話術與自身權力相關性超九成</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">Vitalik捐出數億美元資助AI安全，如今卻說各家AI實驗室嘴上談安全，但他們實際做的事和擴張自身權力的相關性可能超過九成。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">有效利他主義</span><span class=\"tag\">AI安全</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-hay=\"Can You Use AI To Make Good Art? — With Fred Graver Compound Engineering / Compound Writing thousand true fans because/therefore framework (Ken Adams) Flow\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-10-28-aiandi-ai能帮你写剧本-拍节目-却解决不了独立编剧找观众这件事/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/e1445d3aa23a8588-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"A\"><span class=\"dur\">50:51</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">AI &amp; I（Every）</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1028</span></div>\n<h2>AI能幫你寫劇本、拍節目，卻解決不了獨立編劇找觀眾這件事</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">這位艾美獎編劇把創作拆成構思、製作、觸達觀眾三步，AI在前兩步已經很好用，但怎樣讓一千個觀眾願意為你每月付錢，目前還沒人搭好這套基礎設施。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">AI寫作</span><span class=\"tag\">好萊塢</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"The New Full-Stack Designer DialKit scroll jacking showstopper component Sidekick\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-10-28-ycsp-ai能写出任何代码-却分不清什么好看什么难看/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/e7a683c298b3b270-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"Y\"><span class=\"dur\">1:05:43</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">Y Combinator</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1028</span></div>\n<h2>AI能寫出任何代碼，卻分不清什麼好看什麼難看</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">Shopify設計工作室負責人說，AI已經能執行任意技術複雜度，但審美判斷權仍在人手裡——他調一個輪播動畫用了91次提示，靠不斷挑剔而不是動手畫圖，把關最終效果。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">AI協作</span><span class=\"tag\">產品設計</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"He Learned to Code on Paper. Now He&#x27;s Fixing the Internet. | Chai Choudhary, Workers Formal verification Deterministic Simulation Testing (DST) ICP\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-10-28-solofounders-ai生成的代码没人读得懂-验证正从奢侈品变成刚需/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/dde5d2398d6bbf62-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"S\"><span class=\"dur\">1:12:50</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">單人創始人</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1028</span></div>\n<h2>AI生成的代碼沒人讀得懂，驗證正從奢侈品變成剛需</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">過去做系統級驗證成本太高沒人願意做，現在同樣的算力花銷能換來和最嚴苛測試一樣的可靠性，不做反而說不過去。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">軟件驗證</span><span class=\"tag\">形式化驗證</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Why Agents Love Supabase AEO Vitess Multigress declarative schema MVCC\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-10-28-latentspace-企业数据库几乎不会迁移-新客户才是真正能赢的战场/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/303ec709f9a48d84-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"L\"><span class=\"dur\">1:16:38</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">Latent Space</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1028</span></div>\n<h2>企業數據庫幾乎不會遷移：新客戶才是真正能贏的戰場</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">Supabase 內部數據顯示企業幾乎不會把生產數據庫搬家，這決定了他們的增長策略是搶佔綠地新項目，而不是攻克巨頭的存量客戶。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">數據庫基建</span><span class=\"tag\">企業銷售</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ideas\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Freedom of Action: America&#x27;s ASI Strategy, w/ RAND&#x27;s Joel Predd, Ben Boudreaux &amp; Matt Chessen freedom of action strategy wonder weapon pivot factor MAIM (Mutual Assured AI Malfunction)\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-10-28-cogrev-智库说美国现在押注任何一种ai超级智能战略都太早/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/5141cc7bc908a3d0-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">1:50:54</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ideas\"><span class=\"src\">Cognitive Revolution</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1028</span></div>\n<h2>智庫說美國現在押注任何一種AI超級智能戰略都太早</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">七種AI戰略各有清晰的贏法和陰暗結局，但沒人能靠證據分出哪個對，於是RAND的建議是現在把各戰略都用得上的基礎能力先攢出來，而不是提前站隊。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">AI國家戰略</span><span class=\"tag\">地緣政治</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ideas\" data-hay=\"Bealings Bells poltergeist Mysore Wars Domesday Book\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-10-28-stuffmissed-被详细记录两个月的-闹铃-怪谈-可能只是一场讽刺/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/88586eb98e196b1a-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"S\"><span class=\"dur\">34:59</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ideas\"><span class=\"src\">Stuff You Missed in History Class</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1028</span></div>\n<h2>被詳細記錄兩個月的「鬧鈴」怪談，可能只是一場諷刺</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">一位退休軍官詳細記錄自家門鈴無故狂響兩月，卻在「確信非人力」與「可能是騙局」間反覆搖擺——後世研究者認為，這種自相矛盾暴露了此書其實是對輕信靈異者的溫和諷刺。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">靈異傳說</span><span class=\"tag\">歷史懸案</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Artificial Analysis v5 and the benchmarker&#x27;s dilemma benchmax private benchmarks Intelligence Index\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-10-28-interconnects-新榜单让8个闭源模型都赢了最强开源模型-但这更像一次选择/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/06b8dc9e016a16ef-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"I\"><span class=\"dur\">10:38</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">Interconnects</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1028</span></div>\n<h2>新榜單讓8個閉源模型都贏了最強開源模型，但這更像一次選擇</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">AAv5把評測權重押向模型正奔赴的前沿任務而非當下經濟真正倚重的工作流，這個選擇本身就決定了誰看起來更領先。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">基準測試</span><span class=\"tag\">開源模型</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Mark Cuban on Why AI Could Turn Solo Founders Into Trillionaires ASO (Administrative Services Only) PBM (Pharmacy Benefit Manager) BUCA ANDA (Abbreviated New Drug Application) N of one stop loss\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-10-28-a16z-ai对医保最大的用处不是看病-而是揪出合同里的坑/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/7b2f032532c3a865-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">1:01:26</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">a16z</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1028</span></div>\n<h2>AI對醫保最大的用處不是看病，而是揪出合同裡的坑</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">醫療巨頭靠數千家子公司把漲價的錢轉給自己人，合同一旦簽字AI也救不了你——唯一辦法是簽約前就把合同丟給AI問一句：哪裡在坑我。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">醫療保健</span><span class=\"tag\">健康險</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"What&#x27;s Broken About China&#x27;s Economy + The Cost of Keeping China Out | Meg Rithmire mafia firms gray rhino mutual endangerment jiexiaoren anti-involution campaign reverse Tesla\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-10-27-chinatalk-别一刀切禁掉中国电动车-方案是复制当年引进特斯拉的打法/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/bd95dc55d0b863a5-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"C\"><span class=\"dur\">1:34:17</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">ChinaTalk</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1027</span></div>\n<h2>別一刀切禁掉中國電動車：方案是複製當年引進特斯拉的打法</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">中國當年靠強制本地化供應鏈和軟硬件分離，把特斯拉變成了本土產業的老師；美國對中國電動車也該這樣做，而不是一禁了之。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">中國政治經濟</span><span class=\"tag\">腐敗與治理</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"How Anthropic ships the #1 LLM in the World safely: Separating the Brain from the Hands distillation trust grant Claude Managed Agent chain-of-thought extraction brain/hands architecture\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-10-27-latentspace-agent安全不是靠堵沙箱漏洞-而是把大脑和手分开放/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/c081d94ef2cea125-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"L\"><span class=\"dur\">1:46:40</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">Latent Space</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1027</span></div>\n<h2>Agent安全不是靠堵沙箱漏洞，而是把大腦和手分開放</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">Anthropic把執行代理架構拆成常駐服務器上的「大腦」和隨時可銷燬的沙箱「手」，憑證只存在出口網關，agent從未真正碰到過它們，這是意外但最關鍵的安全收益。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">Anthropic</span><span class=\"tag\">AI安全</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Why Silicon Valley can’t slow down AI on its own | Luisa Rodriguez chain of thought AI safety levels checkpoint system superintelligence\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-10-27-eightythousand-ai公司都想减速-却没人敢先停-对手的ai研究员不休息/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/28955397e0f13613-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"8\"><span class=\"dur\">21:19</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">80,000 Hours</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1027</span></div>\n<h2>AI公司都想減速，卻沒人敢先停——對手的AI研究員不休息</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">每一家AI公司都想減速，但沒人敢先停：對手一旦用AI研究員取代人類，暫停一個月換來的可能是被反超幾個月。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">AI監管</span><span class=\"tag\">算力治理</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-hay=\"The airline CEO putting Starlink on every plane catchment-area flying CASM-X blended wing body Value at Risk (VaR)\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-10-27-cheekypint-免费从来不是卖点-联合航空靠starlink的速度甩开对手/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/793e215f9d508567-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"C\"><span class=\"dur\">1:19:35</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">Cheeky Pint</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1027</span></div>\n<h2>免費從來不是賣點，聯合航空靠Starlink的速度甩開對手</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">聯合航空重建技術棧後，把Starlink當作兩三年的競爭窗口全力衝刺，目標是趁機會搶下顧客的長期品牌忠誠度。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">航空業</span><span class=\"tag\">Starlink</span>\n</div></div></a>"]